        "After two enemy turns, control the Blue Dragon and preserve your Wall of Force. You have four ether now and eight channels. Both enemy Pteroses can remove Change of Command for five ether. The first enemy attack can leave your hero on one health; the captured Dragon will still be resting after that attack.",
